  "Marvel's Black Cat, Felicia Hardy, first appeared in The Amazing Spider-Man in 1979.",
  "Cat Noir is the cat-themed hero of the French animated series Miraculous, which began in 2015.",
  "Si and Am are the mischievous Siamese cats in Disney's Lady and the Tramp (1955).",
  "Disney's Oliver and Company (1988) retells Oliver Twist with a kitten as Oliver.",
  "The 1972 film Fritz the Cat was the first animated feature to receive an X rating in the United States.",
  "Cat People (1942) is a horror film about a woman who fears she will turn into a panther.",
  "Bagpuss, a saggy cloth cat, starred in a British children's series in 1974 that ran to only 13 episodes.",
  "Jess, the black and white cat who rides with Postman Pat, first appeared on British television in 1981.",
  "Simon's Cat is an animated web series by Simon Tofield whose first film appeared online in 2008.",
  "The Cat in the BBC comedy Red Dwarf is a vain humanoid descended from the ship's cat.",
  "ThunderCats, a 1985 cartoon, follows a band of cat-like aliens led by Lion-O.",
