  "Harry and Tonto (1974), about an old man travelling with his cat, won Art Carney the Oscar for best actor.",
  "That Darn Cat (1965) is a Disney comedy in which a Siamese cat helps the FBI crack a kidnapping.",
  "Chi's Sweet Home, a manga about a lost kitten adopted by a family, began in 2004.",
  "In 1969 Toei Animation made Puss in Boots, and its cat hero Pero became the studio's mascot.",
  "Cats (2019), the film version of the musical, won the Golden Raspberry for worst picture.",
  "Stray Cat Strut was a 1981 hit for the rockabilly band the Stray Cats.",
  "Cat Stevens was the stage name of the singer born Steven Georgiou, who later became Yusuf Islam.",
