  "Captioned cat photos are older than the internet. Harry Pointer sold comic captioned cat photos in 1870s Brighton.",
  "In Britain and Japan a black cat is traditionally lucky, while in much of Europe and North America it is a bad omen.",
  "In Scottish folklore a strange black cat arriving at a house brings prosperity.",
